  "question": {
    "text": "What amount of bromine will be required to convert 2 g of phenol into 2,4,6-tribromophenol? (Given molar mass in $\\mathrm{g} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}$ of $\\mathrm{C}, \\mathrm{H}, \\mathrm{O}, \\mathrm{Br}$ are $12,1,16,80$ respectively )",
